  "docText": [
    "SOLAR®",
    "Biamp Design System",
    "1.0",
    "Tabs",
    "Sizes",
    "sm (36px)     Dense contexts: side panels, inspector tabs, nested tab strips.\nmd (44px)     Default. Page-level primary tabs and main content tabs.",
    "States (⚠ rename pending)",
    "default     resting, label in color/text/secondary.\nhover       hover lift, text shifts to primary.\nactive      currently-routed tab (persistent) — NOT the mouse-down flash. Flagged to rename to `selected` for clarity.\nfocused     focus ring via shadow/focus/default. Flagged to rename to `focus` to match SOLAR's locked state vocabulary.\ndisabled    tab unavailable; skip on Tab key.",
    "Content",
    "Labels: noun phrase or section name, title case, 1–2 words preferred. Optional leading icon for recognition in icon-heavy products. Optional trailing counter Badge to show quantity (Comments 12). Don't overload with both trailing icon AND counter on the same tab.",
    "Rules",
    "Do\n\n• Use for 2–7 peer views under the same context\n• Make the active tab unambiguous via underline or fill\n• Keep label grammar parallel across tabs\n• Pair with aria-selected and keyboard arrow nav",
    "Don't\n\n• Don't use for ordered flows — use Page Navigator\n• Don't load long-running content on tab switch without a skeleton\n• Don't nest Tabs more than 2 levels deep\n• Don't put destructive actions inside a tab label"
  ],
  "pageContext": null
